        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The diagram below shows the process of making cheese. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Cheese Production Process</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NeImdyOXHo94kJxq6fBlDbq8gPb\">Đề b&agrave;i Cheese Production Process y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất ph&ocirc; mai.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NeImdyOXHo94kJxq6fBlDbq8gPb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Cheese Production Process với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất - ph&ocirc; mai - ph&acirc;n t&aacute;ch nguy&ecirc;n liệu - sản phẩm đ&atilde; ch&iacute;n.</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U3Iudi56UoCSyCxXTNslJsyAgIg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>to&agrave;n bộ quy tr&igrave;nh c&oacute; 9 bước</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UYiUdzMG9o6nrAxbiGElCo7Jg4G\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>quy tr&igrave;nh bắt đầu với việc t&aacute;ch whey khỏi sữa đ&ocirc;ng v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c bằng việc ủ cho ph&ocirc; mai ch&iacute;n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch<strong> chia c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh 2 phần</strong>:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FvEYdRrSGo3Jqcxt55alQorzgYd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QVLfdJCmQoSjuZxJHjnlxT14g5c\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> 5 bước đầu của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DiXAdiPsvoHxT4xfltzl816Lgig\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Krlhdf1uVoylhYxIHbVloEaWggb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>bột whey</strong> <em>(whey)</em> được t&aacute;ch ra khỏi <strong>sữa đ&ocirc;ng</strong> <em>(curds)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ch0ydkFwfoKGcXxY6IVlbY3Zg1w\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>sữa đ&ocirc;ng</strong> <em>(curds)</em> được nghiền nhỏ th&agrave;nh <strong>miếng nhỏ hơn</strong> <em>(smaller pieces)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yvqudhdyaol3tkxrWkTlACDIge6\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>muối</strong> <em>(salt)</em> được rắc l&ecirc;n <strong>sữa đ&ocirc;ng nghiền nhỏ</strong> <em>(milled curds)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wib5dBa3aoQiGsx8hGflKtRwgvB\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>thu được <strong>ph&ocirc; mai tươi</strong> <em>(fresh cheese)</em>, gồm <strong>ph&ocirc; mai cottage v&agrave; ph&ocirc; mai kem</strong> <em>(cottage and cream cheese)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CnlpdPc4PosHX3xlxiglVUDlg3e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>phần <strong>hỗn hợp đ&atilde; rắc muối</strong> <em>(seasoned mixture)</em> c&ograve;n lại được <strong>đổ v&agrave;o khu&ocirc;n</strong> <em>(poured into molds)</em> để tạo h&igrave;nh cho <strong>ph&ocirc; mai</strong> <em>(cheese)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YpJRdIWcboSBrexsMwRl6X1Sgag\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VtsxdzDgGo0OeFx08vdl21p7g5g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: 4 bước c&ograve;n lại của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TlZidAt9qonCtTxs94nlwLTsgGg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>c&aacute;c <strong>khu&ocirc;n ph&ocirc; mai</strong> <em>(cheese-filled molds)</em> được &eacute;p để <strong>t&aacute;ch th&ecirc;m whey </strong><em>(additional whey is extracted)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SLDkd8hnLoWLO3xl8YmlNWAugGd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>ph&ocirc; mai đ&atilde; &eacute;p</strong> <em>(pressed cheese pieces)</em> được đặt l&ecirc;n <strong>kệ chuy&ecirc;n dụng</strong> <em>(special shelves)</em> để ủ ch&iacute;n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F1kbdkEDtoUKW7xjVpalayy7gTb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>sản phẩm cuối c&ugrave;ng l&agrave; <strong>ph&ocirc; mai đ&atilde; ủ ch&iacute;n</strong> <em>(fully ripened cheese) </em>ở dạng <strong>khối tr&ograve;n</strong> <em>(rounded blocks)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
